_refine_special_details          
; 
Structure was phased by intrinsic methods (Sheldrick, 2015).  Systematic 
conditions suggested the ambiguous space group.  The space group choice 
was confirmed by successful convergence of the full-matrix least-squares 
refinement on F^2^.  The highest peaks in the final difference Fourier 
map were in the vicinity of the Th atom; the final map had no other 
significant features.  A final analysis of variance between observed and 
calculated structure factors showed little dependence on amplitude and 
resolution. 
;
